{# Jinja2 context for DOCX document generation.

Variables available:
  - title: str
  - date: str (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - duration: str (HH:MM:SS)
  - filename: str
  - summary: str (200-300 words)
  - key_points: list[dict] with topic, content, importance
  - decisions: list[dict] with content, proposer
  - action_items: list[dict] with content, assignee, deadline
  - tags: list[str]

This template is parsed by the DOCX generation service and applied
via python-docx. The content structure mirrors the Markdown template.
#}
